# Mode$ Vote (VoteEffect.java:128, triggerhooks.go): both players vote
# torture on Tyrant's Choice, so the AI loses 4 life; when voting ends,
# Model of Unity's trigger lets the human (and the AI, who voted the same)
# scry 2. The human keeps both on top.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 B
tapformana human 4 B
queue paygeneric B
queue abilitychoice 1
queue abilitychoice 1
queue confirmeffect true
queue confirmeffect true
queue scry 5,6
castspell human 1
resolvestack
resolvestack
